This is a placeholder for the architecture diagram referenced as data-flow.png in the README.md. Please export the PlantUML diagram from diagrams/architecture.puml or use a diagramming tool to generate the PNG and place it here.

Diagram overview:
- API Gateway and Unified Access Layer
- Cosmos DB (Hot) for recent data
- Blob Storage (Cold) for archived data
- CDN for cold data acceleration
- Cognitive Search for cold data queries
- Azure Functions for archival and monitoring

For a production diagram, use PlantUML or draw.io to convert the PlantUML source to PNG.
